Reviewed, approved with one small request that does not need a re-review.

- The fold count is stored in the alert payload but not in the notification text; the night-shift supervisors will want to see "(x4)" in the SMS. One-line change in notify/format.py.
- Window key: you include station but the Veritas Line 4 stations report as a shared station ID after their MES change. Not your problem to solve here; I opened TES-431 so we remember.
- Runbook updated to mention the knob: https://runbooks.tessera.io/alerts/late-lot#dedupe

Merge when CI is green. Nice test on the midnight rollover.

